    "created_at": "2025-09-09T07:21:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-09T07:21:37Z",
    "body": "Okay, so in Fetch we restrict the recommendation to web browsers (which as per https://github.com/whatwg/infra/issues/678 should probably be defined at some point) and for `appVersion` we could either assert that it starts with `Mozilla/5.0 (` or account for that not always being the case. The latter is probably more pragmatic.",
